@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam participantBorderColor #D4A017
skinparam participantFontColor #D4A017
skinparam participantFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #D4A017
skinparam sequenceActorFontColor #D4A017
skinparam arrowColor #555555
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #D4A017
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFCE8
skinparam sequenceBoxBorderColor #D4A017
skinparam sequenceBoxFontColor #D4A017
skinparam sequenceBoxBackgroundColor #FFFCE8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFCE8
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4A017

title **Nurse Cancellation & Reassignment** — Sequence Diagram

actor "Patient" as PAT
participant "Patient App" as PAPP
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Booking\nService" as BKS
participant "Notification\nService" as NOT
actor "Nurse" as NUR
participant "Nurse App" as NAPP
participant "Admin Panel" as ADMP

== Pre-Condition: Active Booking ==

note right #FFFCE8
  Booking state before cancellation:
  status ∈ {NURSE_CONFIRMED, EN_ROUTE, ARRIVED}
end note

== Nurse Initiates Cancellation ==

NUR -> NAPP: Tap "Cancel Booking"
NAPP -> NAPP: Show cancellation reason selection

note right #FFFCE8
  Required reason selection:
  1. طارئ شخصي (Personal emergency)
  2. المسافة أبعد من المتوقع
     (Location too far)
  3. الخدمة خارج تخصصي
     (Outside my specialization)
  4. مشكلة في المواصلات
     (Transportation issue)
  5. أخرى (Other — free text)
end note

NUR -> NAPP: Select reason + confirm
NAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/nurse/bookings/{id}/cancel
GW -> BKS: Process cancellation

BKS -> BKS: Validate booking is cancellable by nurse
BKS -> BKS: Set status = CANCELLED_BY_NURSE
BKS -> BKS: Store cancellation_reason
BKS -> BKS: Store cancelled_by = nurse_id
BKS -> BKS: Set cancelled_at = now
BKS -> BKS: Increment nurse cancellation counter

== Patient Notification ==

BKS -> NOT: Push "Your nurse has cancelled"
NOT -> NOT: Urgent push notification

NOT --> PAPP: "Nurse cancelled — finding new provider"
PAPP --> PAT: Show cancellation alert + "Finding alternatives..."

== Reassignment Flow ==

BKS -> BKS: Check original ServiceRequest
BKS -> BKS: Reset request to PENDING_OFFERS
BKS -> BKS: Exclude cancelling nurse from new broadcast

BKS -> LOC: Find nearby nurses (excluding canceller)
LOC --> BKS: List of available nurses

loop For each available nurse
  BKS -> NOT: Send push "New Request Available"
  NOT --> NAPP: Re-broadcast to new nurses
end

== New Offers Cycle ==

PAPP --> PAT: "New offers are coming in..."

NUR2 -> BKS: Submit new offer
BKS --> PAPP: Real-time: New offer received
PAPP --> PAT: Display new offers list

PAT -> PAPP: Select new nurse
PAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/requests/{id}/select-offer
GW -> BKS: Assign new nurse

== Alternate Paths ==

alt No Nurses Available
  BKS -> BKS: Timeout — no offers received
  BKS -> NOT: Push "No nurses available"
  NOT --> PAPP: "No nurses available in your area"
  PAPP --> PAT: Options: Cancel or Retry

  alt Patient Cancels
    PAT -> PAPP: Cancel request
    PAPP -> GW: POST /api/v1/requests/{id}/cancel
    GW -> BKS: Cancel request
    BKS -> BKS: Set status = CANCELLED_BY_PATIENT
    BKS -> NOT: Notify admin of cancellation cascade
    NOT --> ADMP: "Booking cancelled — no replacement found"
  end
end

== Admin Monitoring ==

BKS -> ADMP: Log cancellation with full audit trail
ADMP -> ADMP: Update nurse cancellation statistics

note right #FFFCE8
  Quality tracking:
  - Cancellation rate tracked per nurse
  - If rate > 15%, admin alerted
  - Flagged for potential deactivation
end note

== Audit Trail ==

BKS -> BKS: Log audit entry
note right #FFFCE8
  Audit log captures:
  - Original nurse ID
  - Cancellation reason
  - Timestamp of cancellation
  - New assignment (if any)
  - Time to reassignment
end note

@enduml
